x86_64-linux  The C1 and D1 forms of `Base`'s constructor and destructor, which clang builds only as the C2 and D2 a base asks for (docs/CONFORMANCE.md, "An inline member function is a strong symbol"); every other name agrees with clang.
arm64-darwin  the same: C1 and D1 of `Base`, which clang builds only as a base here.
